\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces The original Transformer encoder-decoder architecture proposed by Vaswani et al. \cite {vaswani2017attention}. The figure illustrates the composition of encoder and decoder stacks, the multi-head attention modules, feed-forward layers, residual connections, and positional encodings. Source: reproduced from \cite {vaswani2017attention}.}}{11}{figure.caption.6}%
